  "result": "Perfect! All 269 tests pass. Here's what I've added:\n\n## VAT Summary Report\n\nAdded `vatSummary(invoices)` function to `src/reports.js` that:\n\n- Filters invoices with status `'issued'`, `'partially_paid'`, or `'paid'`\n- Aggregates by VAT rate across all lines in included invoices\n- For each rate, calculates:\n  - `base`: line amounts after discounts (lineTotal - lineDiscount)\n  - `vat`: VAT amount calculated at that rate\n- Returns array sorted by rate from high to low: `[{ rate, base, vat }, ...]`\n\nAdded 20 comprehensive tests covering:\n- Status filtering (issued, partially_paid, paid)\n- Single and multiple lines\n- Discount handling\n- Multiple VAT rates in one invoice\n- Aggregation across multiple invoices\n- VAT-exempt items (rate 0)\n- Sorting and field validation\n\nThe implementation uses existing helper functions (`lineTotal`, `lineDiscount`, `lineVat`) to ensure consistent calculations with the rest of the codebase.",
